#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:9 84bcb5708eb14ad986eab4cc743fccc9
msgid ""
"ArduPilot has introduced support for `Lua <https://www.lua.org/>`_ "
"scripting. Scripting provides a safe, \"sandboxed\" environment for new "
"behaviors to be added to the autopilot without modifying the core flight "
"code. Scripts are stored on the SD card and run in parallel with the flight "
"code."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 引入了对 `Lua <https://www.lua.org/>`_ "
"脚本的支持。脚本提供了一个安全的「沙箱」环境，可以在不修改核心飞控代码的情况下向飞控添加新行为。脚本存储在 SD 卡上，与飞控代码并行运行。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:13
#: 8b58f55ae04d4413a3c3e40d44647195
msgid ""
"This page describes how to setup scripts on your autopilot, the scripting "
"API, scripting applets,and some examples to help get started."
msgstr "本页介绍如何在飞控上设置脚本、脚本 API、脚本应用程序以及一些入门示例。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:15
#: 167575a1485a46258c21c7be64586ab4
msgid ""
"While scripting normally requires at least some LUA programming and editing,"
" there are some `Applets "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets>`__"
"  available which require no user editing and are ready to use. See links "
"below."
msgstr ""
"虽然脚本通常需要一定的 LUA 编程和编辑，但有些 `应用程序 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets>`__"
"  无需用户编辑，可直接使用。请参阅下方链接。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:19
#: 12d575764a914b80bb545036bcb7c8f4
msgid "Getting Started"
msgstr "入门"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:21
#: 7f985fb4d27c4e57b97f4adbb3aad93b
msgid ""
"Ensure your autopilot has at least 2 MB of flash and 80 kB of memory.  High "
"powered autopilots like the CubePilot Cube Orange and HolyBro Durandal will "
"certainly work well but check the specifications of your :ref:`autopilot "
"<common-autopilots>`. Scripting is not available in F4 based autopilots. "
"Autopilots must have an SD card to store the script unless the user builds "
"his own firmware and embeds it directly in the firmware (see :ref:`common-"
"oem-customizations`)."
msgstr ""
"确保您的飞控至少有 2 MB 闪存和 80 KB 内存。CubePilot Cube Orange 和 HolyBro Durandal "
"等高性能飞控肯定可以正常工作，但请检查您的 :ref:`飞控 <common-autopilots>` 规格。脚本在基于 F4 "
"的飞控上不可用。飞控必须有 SD 卡来存储脚本，除非用户自行构建固件并将其直接嵌入固件（参见 :ref:`common-oem-"
"customizations`）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:22
#: d0e32f447b004399ba2d0d4b1debf06a
