"Set :ref:`SCR_ENABLE <SCR_ENABLE>` to 1 to enable scripting (refresh or "
"reboot to see all ``SCR_`` parameters)."
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`SCR_ENABLE <SCR_ENABLE>` 设为 1 以启用脚本功能（刷新或重启以查看所有 ``SCR_`` 参数）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:23
#: 6fc30089f6834de799be902083fe6e90
msgid ""
"Upload scripts (files with extension .lua) to the autopilot's SD card's "
"``APM/scripts`` folder."
msgstr "将脚本（扩展名为 .lua 的文件）上传到飞控 SD 卡的 ``APM/scripts`` 文件夹。"

