#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:76
#: b5578ec865a2479192c9c6fde7674442
msgid ""
"The following script is used to change a servo output based on the "
"aircraft's distance from the home position."
msgstr "以下脚本根据飞机与 Home 点的距离来改变舵机输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:97
#: 0409264acde24915b6a7e41758f870de
msgid ""
"This script begins by defining the update function, which will be called "
"periodically. This function fetches the vehicles current position and home "
"position, and stores them within the local variables current_pos and home. "
"Both of these variables now either hold a Location userdata, or are nil, if "
"the information was not currently available from the vehicle. The variables "
"are then checked to ensure that they were actually provided, before "
"calculating the distance between the locations. After a check to ensure that"
" the distance is never measured as more then 1 kilometer away, the distance "
"is used to set the servo position. The final line in the function is used to"
" reschedule this function to be run again in 1000 milliseconds from the "
"current time. The last line of the script is also used to schedule the "
"function to be run for the first time in 1000 milliseconds from the time at "
"which it's loaded."
msgstr ""
"此脚本首先定义将被定期调用的 update 函数。该函数获取飞行器当前位置和 Home 点位置，并存储在局部变量 current_pos 和 home "
"中。这两个变量现在要么包含 Location 用户数据，要么为 "
"nil（如果飞行器当前无法获取该信息）。然后检查这些变量以确保实际提供了数据，再计算位置之间的距离。检查距离不超过 1 "
"公里后，用距离设置舵机位置。函数中的最后一行用于将此函数重新安排在当前时间 1000 毫秒后再次运行。脚本的最后一行也用于安排该函数在加载后 1000 "
"毫秒首次运行。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:106
#: e114f9310f984c0da0a3f87855252acb
msgid "Script Crashes and Errors"
msgstr "脚本崩溃和错误"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:107
#: ce37b607547248faa31aa348d22857ea
msgid ""
"If scripts run out of memory (or panic for any reason) all currently running"
" scripts are terminated. If an individual script has an error, it will "
"terminate. If either occurs before arming, a pre-arm failure will be "
"generated. A scripting restart command or reboot would be needed to restart "
"the script or scripting as a whole."
msgstr ""
"如果脚本内存耗尽（或因任何原因崩溃），所有当前运行的脚本将被终止。如果单个脚本出现错误，它将终止。如果在解锁前发生上述任何情况，将生成解锁前失败。需要脚本重启命令或重启才能重新启动脚本或整个脚本系统。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:109
#: fe04def2b92843b38ff259a3ac1fc073
msgid ""
"In order to prevent arming if a script is missing (ie. SD card ejected or "
"file corrupted) or if a script that is supposed to run once before arming "
"and then terminate, but does not, then either, or both, of two checksum pre-"
"arm checks can be enabled:"
msgstr "为了在脚本丢失时（如 SD 卡弹出或文件损坏）或脚本应在解锁前运行一次后终止但未终止时防止解锁，可以启用两种校验和解锁前检查之一或两者："

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:111
#: 3c34d49d096c4828b2679a78f9d6e0c2
msgid ""
":ref:`SCR_LD_CHECKSUM<SCR_LD_CHECKSUM>` which checks that the checksum of "
"all loaded scripts matches this value"
msgstr ":ref:`SCR_LD_CHECKSUM<SCR_LD_CHECKSUM>` 检查所有已加载脚本的校验和是否与该值匹配"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:112
#: 15dffe3c9284462fbd2b0a61028b2f47
msgid ""
":ref:`SCR_RUN_CHECKSUM<SCR_RUN_CHECKSUM>` which checks that the checksum of "
"all running scripts matches this value"
msgstr ":ref:`SCR_RUN_CHECKSUM<SCR_RUN_CHECKSUM>` 检查所有运行中脚本的校验和是否与该值匹配"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:114
#: 4b98fea79601444cbcc0fef89df0601f
msgid ""
"These can be set automatically when the scripts have been loaded and the "
"desired ones running before arming, by setting the "
":ref:`SCR_DEBUG_OPTS<SCR_DEBUG_OPTS>` bit 5 which will compute and set these"
" parameter's values, and then reset bit 5 automatically."
msgstr ""
"当脚本已加载并在解锁前运行所需脚本时，可以通过设置 :ref:`SCR_DEBUG_OPTS<SCR_DEBUG_OPTS>` 第 5 "
"位自动设置这些参数值，然后自动重置第 5 位。"

