#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:145
#: 1a6e1182538a4ed48e29098680e619c5
msgid "Location"
msgstr "Location"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:147
#: d6fafef2c01a430191b04491e1ccc505
msgid ""
"Location is a userdata object that holds locations expressed as latitude, "
"longitude, altitude. The altitude can be in several different frames, "
"relative to home, absolute altitude above mean sea level, or relative to "
"terrain. To create a new Location userdata you can call Location() to "
"allocate an empty location object, or call a method that returns one to you."
msgstr ""
"Location 是一个用户数据对象，以纬度、经度、高度的形式表示位置。高度可以有多种坐标系，即相对于 Home "
"点、相对于平均海平面的绝对高度或相对于地形。要创建新的 Location 用户数据，可以调用 Location() 分配一个空的位置对象，或调用某个返回"
" Location 的方法。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:149
#: 2c01beb590fd4b80b83bb3d1c6db150c
msgid "A Location userdata object supports the following calls:"
msgstr "Location 用户数据对象支持以下调用："

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:151
#: 7ed6b7ac103045708adf7e7647b5bf4f
msgid ""
":code:`lat( [new_lat] )` - If called with no arguments, returns the current "
"latitude in degrees * 1e7 as an integer. If called with one argument, it "
"will assign the value to the latitude."
msgstr ""
":code:`lat( [new_lat] )` - 如果不带参数调用，则以整数形式返回当前纬度（度 * "
"1e7）。如果带一个参数调用，则将该值赋给纬度。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:153
#: ea6e0b7c2965467d88aa4da7fd9055a1
msgid ""
":code:`lng( [new_lng] )` - If called with no arguments, returns the current "
"longitude in degrees * 1e7 as an integer. If called with one argument, it "
"will assign the value to the longitude."
msgstr ""
":code:`lng( [new_lng] )` - 如果不带参数调用，则以整数形式返回当前经度（度 * "
"1e7）。如果带一个参数调用，则将该值赋给经度。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:155
#: cc0a4267ac5d4653906d511e9d9f9b53
msgid ""
":code:`alt( [new_alt] )` - If called with no arguments, returns the current "
"altitude in cm as an integer. If called with one argument, it will assign "
"the value to the altitude."
msgstr ""
":code:`alt( [new_alt] )` - 如果不带参数调用，则以整数形式返回当前高度（厘米）。如果带一个参数调用，则将该值赋给高度。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:157
#: a61d417420ad48c8a931ff17fed530a2
msgid ""
":code:`relative_alt( [is_relative] )` - If called with no arguments returns "
"true if the location is planned as relative to home. If called with a "
"boolean value this will set the relative altitude."
msgstr ""
":code:`relative_alt( [is_relative] )` - 如果不带参数调用，则当位置规划为相对于 Home 点时返回 "
"true。如果带布尔值调用，则设置相对高度标志。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:159
#: 76c910ff1d0345b5b812d64d3656fe51
msgid ""
":code:`terrain_alt( [is_terrain] )` - If called with no arguments returns "
"true if the location is planned as relative to terrain. If called with a "
"boolean value this will flag if the altitude should be relative to terrain."
msgstr ""
":code:`terrain_alt( [is_terrain] )` - 如果不带参数调用，则当位置规划为相对于地形时返回 "
"true。如果带布尔值调用，则设置是否相对地形的标志。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:161
#: 5305405a01634e158168b3c6a2e9375a
msgid ""
":code:`origin_alt( [is_origin] )` - If called with no arguments returns true"
" if the location is planned in absolute altitude relative to mean sea level."
" If called with a boolean value this will set the altitude to be relative to"
" mean sea level."
msgstr ""
":code:`origin_alt( [is_origin] )` - 如果不带参数调用，则当位置规划为相对于平均海平面的绝对高度时返回 "
"true。如果带布尔值调用，则设置高度为相对于平均海平面。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:163
#: 9f5f16adfa6644cca612709b212a85e5
msgid ""
":code:`loiter_xtrack( [should_xtrack] )` - If the location is used for a "
"loiter location this flags if the aircraft should track from the center "
"point, or from the exit location of the loiter."
msgstr ""
":code:`loiter_xtrack( [should_xtrack] )` - "
"如果该位置用于盘旋位置，此标志指示飞机是否应从中心点还是从盘旋退出位置进行航迹跟踪。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:165
#: 09ff47e167b346b18dd7bae5eb9a5a4b
msgid ""
":code:`get_distance( other_Location )` - Given a Location this calculates "
"the horizontal distance between the two locations in meters."
msgstr ""
":code:`get_distance( other_Location )` - 给定一个 Location，计算两个位置之间的水平距离（米）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:167
#: 15244486a76e482d8ecf69cf705e0b7a
msgid ""
":code:`offset( offset_north ,  offset_east )` - Translates this Location by "
"the specified number of meters."
msgstr ":code:`offset( offset_north ,  offset_east )` - 将此 Location 按指定的米数偏移。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:169
#: 78d8666838474995ade6b78186b54da8
msgid ""
":code:`get_vector_from_origin_NEU()` - Returns nil or Vector3f that contains"
" the offset from the EKF origin to this location. This will return nil if "
"the EKF origin wasn’t available at the time this was called."
msgstr ""
":code:`get_vector_from_origin_NEU()` - 返回 nil 或包含从 EKF 原点到此位置偏移量的 "
"Vector3f。如果调用时 EKF 原点不可用，则返回 nil。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:171
#: cff563e0d1f54cd9b8113a20846bb1bf
msgid ""
":code:`get_bearing( other_Location )` - Given a Location this calculates the"
" relative bearing to the location in radians"
msgstr ""
":code:`get_bearing( other_Location )` - 给定一个 Location，计算到该位置的相对方位角（弧度）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:173
#: 0326b27b1444468fa23386a6234b6770
msgid ""
":code:`get_distance_NED( other_Location )` - Returns nil or Vector3f that "
"contains the 3D vector in meters to the other Location."
msgstr ""
":code:`get_distance_NED( other_Location )` - 返回 nil 或包含到另一个 Location "
"的三维向量（米）的 Vector3f。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:175
#: e55f26e2d13d49069ea91e3104df0776
msgid ""
":code:`get_distance_NE( other_Location )` - Returns nil or Vector2f that "
"contains the 2D vector in meters to the other Location."
msgstr ""
":code:`get_distance_NE( other_Location )` - 返回 nil 或包含到另一个 Location "
"的二维向量（米）的 Vector2f。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:178
#: 78975540beac40c99f9b2cb9f03d95c1
msgid "Vector2f"
msgstr "Vector2f"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:180
#: 8cf06d9681a8483d98602f69ea01115e
msgid ""
"Vector2f is a userdata object that holds a 2D vector. The components are "
"stored as floating point numbers. To create a new Vector2f you can call "
"Vector2f() to allocate a new one, or call a method that returns one to you."
msgstr ""
"Vector2f 是一个存储二维向量的用户数据对象，各分量以浮点数形式存储。要创建新的 Vector2f，可以调用 Vector2f() "
"分配一个新对象，或调用某个返回 Vector2f 的方法。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:182
#: a034cc7f3bc649108672b4190de95336
msgid "A Vector2f object supports the following calls:"
msgstr "Vector2f 对象支持以下调用："

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:184
#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:211
#: 0c6b679a855c4923853ce110e0f8fb95 650c7b5369eb435bb08f6100670f8b28
msgid ""
":code:`x( [new_x] )` - If called with no arguments, return the currently set"
" X component as a floating point number. If called with one argument it will"
" assign the value to the X component."
msgstr ":code:`x( [new_x] )` - 如果不带参数调用，则以浮点数返回当前 X 分量。如果带一个参数调用，则将该值赋给 X 分量。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:186
#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:213
#: 15de476962144afbab670651122e4a2c b518ce9e866c4e8d8e3eae380f1c50f1
msgid ""
":code:`y( [new_y] )` - If called with no arguments, return the currently set"
" Y component as a floating point number. If called with one argument it will"
" assign the value to the Y component."
msgstr ":code:`y( [new_y] )` - 如果不带参数调用，则以浮点数返回当前 Y 分量。如果带一个参数调用，则将该值赋给 Y 分量。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:188
#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:217
#: 5c6ac271e96a4c22ab85cc19cb84a846 844ba9e41fd94611b49cbccc57a09c98
msgid ""
":code:`length()` - Returns the length of the vector as a floating point "
"number."
msgstr ":code:`length()` - 以浮点数返回向量的长度。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:190
#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:219
#: 26dbfa01cddc4f7a8e861260db20f6eb 6710a32383074a908587b9d5110ed866
msgid ":code:`normalize()` - Normalizes the vector to be a unit vector."
msgstr ":code:`normalize()` - 将向量归一化为单位向量。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:192
#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:221
#: c74515e7c2d241bcb73a5e257e86819b dc793f63216f443cb7d234e03d7d282f
msgid ""
":code:`is_nan()` - Returns true if the vector contains any NaN members."
msgstr ":code:`is_nan()` - 如果向量包含任何 NaN 成员则返回 true。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:194
#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:223
#: 120ae73f6fe04babb2a2bca6cce1fb3e 3c7bec8851274cef8be8fc8a2e06e916
msgid ""
":code:`is_inf()` - Returns true if the vector contains any infinity members."
msgstr ":code:`is_inf()` - 如果向量包含任何无穷大成员则返回 true。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:196
#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:225
#: 351d3819f9454fc1acf2755867e458a1 c2159e9d78ac45a8af571636d2c41d8a
msgid ":code:`is_zero()` - Returns true if all the vector fields are 0."
msgstr ":code:`is_zero()` - 如果所有向量字段均为 0 则返回 true。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:198
#: 85cae77e3f5d49669b272a3b74f328af
msgid "The following operators are supported on a Vector2f:"
msgstr "Vector2f 支持以下运算符："

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:200
#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:229
#: 7d9739db51da43ea89429bb11ef9efaf ccf615a322064032a3a6a18a95c45d2e
msgid ":code:`+` - Adds the two vectors by components."
msgstr ":code:`+` - 按分量相加两个向量。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:202
#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:231
#: 29298e2ea6e9408895f9c010bc33f69f ae3820decb034c97aa8d22140593b60d
msgid ":code:`-` - Subtracts the two vectors by components."
msgstr ":code:`-` - 按分量相减两个向量。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:205
#: c7511c1f25ee4800b051ca8f3e864f30
msgid "Vector3f"
msgstr "Vector3f"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:207
#: c9c144896d2543c1baf845568c5dd35d
msgid ""
"Vector3f is a userdata object that holds a 3D vector. The components are "
"stored as floating point numbers. To create a new Vector3f you can call "
"Vector3f() to allocate a new one, or call a method that returns one to you."
msgstr ""
"Vector3f 是一个存储三维向量的用户数据对象，各分量以浮点数形式存储。要创建新的 Vector3f，可以调用 Vector3f() "
"分配一个新对象，或调用某个返回 Vector3f 的方法。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:209
#: a10437390ad346729ea183ccd293cd47
msgid "A Vector3f object supports the following calls:"
msgstr "Vector3f 对象支持以下调用："

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:215
#: fe5f641c22f84c45bb9a6149548c02f3
msgid ""
":code:`z( [new_z] )` - If called with no arguments, return the currently set"
" Z component as a floating point number. If called with one argument it will"
" assign the value to the Z component."
msgstr ":code:`z( [new_z] )` - 如果不带参数调用，则以浮点数返回当前 Z 分量。如果带一个参数调用，则将该值赋给 Z 分量。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:227
#: d9b05db754c4430f988bb0cc09f8d99d
msgid "The following operators are supported on a Vector3f:"
msgstr "Vector3f 支持以下运算符："

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:234
#: 18a9cd12588843f99972f52a8ffe719e
msgid "AHRS (ahrs:)"
msgstr "AHRS (ahrs:)"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:236
#: 682ae5a6f1ac4f1bbf00013e27c21b92
msgid ""
"The ahrs library represents the Attitude Heading Reference System computed "
"by the autopilot. It provides estimates for the vehicles attitude, and "
"position."
msgstr "ahrs 库代表飞控计算的姿态航向参考系统（AHRS），提供飞行器姿态和位置的估计。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:238
#: 1446ea0f9e92485fa82445bd9a71c04a
msgid ""
":code:`get_roll()` - Returns the current vehicle roll angle in radians."
msgstr ":code:`get_roll()` - 返回当前飞行器横滚角（弧度）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:240
#: aee90fdca7134021aa079a5a7415738e
msgid ""
":code:`get_pitch()` - Returns the current vehicle pitch angle in radians."
msgstr ":code:`get_pitch()` - 返回当前飞行器俯仰角（弧度）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:242
#: 56ebc975d86f409abd8b93d61fbcbd65
msgid ":code:`get_yaw()` - Returns the current vehicle yaw angle in radians."
msgstr ":code:`get_yaw()` - 返回当前飞行器偏航角（弧度）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:244
#: cbdd4bf15081417780d4372956a996eb
msgid ""
":code:`get_position()` - Returns nil or Location userdata that contains the "
"vehicles current position. Note: This will only return a Location if the "
"system considers the current estimate to be reasonable."
msgstr ""
":code:`get_position()` - 返回 nil 或包含飞行器当前位置的 Location "
"用户数据。注意：仅在系统认为当前估计合理时才返回 Location。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:246
#: b04ba8e041484644ad91e020fec574e4
msgid ""
":code:`get_home()` - Returns a Location that contains the vehicles current "
"home waypoint."
msgstr ":code:`get_home()` - 返回包含飞行器当前 Home 航点的 Location。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:248
#: dc0090fcb80841cb99766ca5fa767b44
msgid ""
":code:`get_gyro()` - Returns a Vector3f containing the current smoothed and "
"filtered gyro rates (in radians/second)"
msgstr ":code:`get_gyro()` - 返回包含当前平滑滤波后陀螺仪速率（弧度/秒）的 Vector3f。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:250
#: c916e74a09034ac0b6e27301a81da058
msgid ""
":code:`get_hagl()` - Returns nil, or the latest altitude estimate above "
"ground level in meters"
msgstr ":code:`get_hagl()` - 返回 nil，或最新的离地高度估计（米）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:252
#: a29a0e2f07e2418f94bd2dbac816b1c2
msgid ""
":code:`wind_estimate()` - Returns a Vector3f containing the current wind "
"estimate for the vehicle."
msgstr ":code:`wind_estimate()` - 返回包含飞行器当前风速估计的 Vector3f。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:254
#: 7cc10c03214d4affb8e4d2866c382a6a
msgid ""
":code:`groundspeed_vector()` - Returns a Vector2f containing the vehicles "
"velocity in meters/second in north and east components."
msgstr ":code:`groundspeed_vector()` - 返回包含飞行器北向和东向速度分量（米/秒）的 Vector2f。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:256
#: 26f345297151465683eeb6cce7e7f562
msgid ""
":code:`get_velocity_NED()` - Returns nil, or a Vector3f containing the "
"current NED vehicle velocity in meters/second in north, east, and down "
"components."
msgstr ""
":code:`get_velocity_NED()` - 返回 nil，或包含当前 NED 飞行器速度（米/秒，北、东、下分量）的 Vector3f。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:258
#: f5c862e96b3845aca6b2223834547dbd
msgid ""
":code:`get_velocity_NE()` - Returns nil, or a Vector2f containing the "
"current NE vehicle velocity in meters/second in north and east components."
msgstr ""
":code:`get_velocity_NE()` - 返回 nil，或包含当前 NE 飞行器速度（米/秒，北向和东向分量）的 Vector2f。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:260
#: 0e15f37b3edf458eb3a1a0759c25a834
msgid ":code:`home_is_set()` - Returns a true if home position has been set."
msgstr ":code:`home_is_set()` - 如果 Home 位置已设置则返回 true。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:262
#: ee9a8630b90a4c12bd5d59942a30d4e8
msgid ""
":code:`prearm_healthy()` - Returns a true if current pre-arm checks are "
"passing."
msgstr ":code:`prearm_healthy()` - 如果当前解锁前检查全部通过则返回 true。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:264
#: 4f514f4eb7aa4c659abd48ca08cd3d9b
msgid ""
":code:`airspeed_estimate()` - Returns current airspeed estimate in "
"meters/second or nil."
msgstr ":code:`airspeed_estimate()` - 返回当前空速估计（米/秒）或 nil。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:268
#: b7f474e3095e41b3b8d139f7f1a470a0
msgid "Arming (arming:)"
msgstr "Arming (arming:)"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:270
#: 8d7e883976044b7d850ee91d686955b1
msgid "The Arming library provides access to arming status and commands."
msgstr "Arming 库提供对解锁状态和解锁指令的访问。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:272
#: f600a04d1a6743798b9cf8112e4d723d
msgid ""
":code:`disarm()` - Disarms the vehicle in all cases. Returns false only if "
"already disarmed."
msgstr ":code:`disarm()` - 在任何情况下均对飞行器上锁。仅在已上锁时返回 false。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:274
#: 5cb562f65a1449e6ace41f0e74baa05c
msgid ":code:`is_armed()` -Returns a true if vehicle is currently armed."
msgstr ":code:`is_armed()` - 如果飞行器当前已解锁则返回 true。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:276
#: 8c9fd03da34a4b34ae823b0e72672f94
msgid ""
":code:`arm()` - Attempts to arm the vehicle. Returns true if successful."
msgstr ":code:`arm()` - 尝试解锁飞行器。成功则返回 true。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:280
#: 9773205413bb42469f81439050a0c2f9
msgid "Battery (battery:)"
msgstr "Battery (battery:)"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:282
#: 42479fb23f7342a6a3d505c98252ca5d
msgid ""
"The battery library provides access to information about the currently "
"connected batteries on the vehicle."
msgstr "battery 库提供对飞行器当前连接电池信息的访问。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:284
#: 3a51816468084034853c840ef599e79b
msgid ""
":code:`num_instances()` - Returns the number of battery instances currently "
"available."
msgstr ":code:`num_instances()` - 返回当前可用的电池实例数量。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:286
#: ef49d80c82fd44f497dcb7d9420cc683
msgid ""
":code:`healthy( instance )` - Returns true if the requested battery instance"
" is healthy. Healthy is considered to be ArduPilot is currently able to "
"monitor the battery."
msgstr ""
":code:`healthy( instance )` - 如果请求的电池实例正常则返回 true。「正常」指 ArduPilot 当前能够监控该电池。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:288
#: 9cf9f20f6cce4d39ac73ff6b4b9874f5
msgid ""
":code:`voltage( instance )` - Returns the voltage of the selected battery "
"instance."
msgstr ":code:`voltage( instance )` - 返回所选电池实例的电压。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:290
#: 4130e47a7f3b4981aef2f2f30f3e727a
msgid ""
":code:`voltage_resting( instance )` - Returns the estimated battery voltage "
"if it was not under load."
msgstr ":code:`voltage_resting( instance )` - 返回电池在无负载情况下的估计电压。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:292
#: 5aaf158d70544664a6d9304f82bc0ba6
msgid ""
":code:`current_amps( instance )` - Returns the current (in Amps) that is "
"currently being consumed by the battery, or nil if current monitoring is not"
" available."
msgstr ":code:`current_amps( instance )` - 返回电池当前消耗的电流（安培），如果不支持电流监控则返回 nil。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:294
#: f50f6737707442ffbf402492d1fa356b
msgid ""
":code:`consumed_mah( instance )` - Returns the capacity (in milliamp hours) "
"used from the battery, or nil if current monitoring is not available."
msgstr ":code:`consumed_mah( instance )` - 返回电池已消耗的容量（毫安时），如果不支持电流监控则返回 nil。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:296
#: 57d0fc58d6064a9295a554fd75e2381f
msgid ""
":code:`consumed_wh( instance )` - Returns the used watt hours from the "
"battery, or nil if energy monitoring is not available."
msgstr ":code:`consumed_wh( instance )` - 返回电池已消耗的瓦时，如果不支持能量监控则返回 nil。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:298
#: c6ade73425ec42c287dad4bdb33091a9
msgid ""
":code:`capacity_remaining_pct( instance )` - Returns the remaining "
"percentage of battery (from 0 to 100)"
msgstr ":code:`capacity_remaining_pct( instance )` - 返回电池剩余电量百分比（0 到 100）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:300
#: 92a52dc158a14963bfed242d7033f999
msgid ""
":code:`pack_capacity_mah( instance )` - Returns the full pack capacity (in "
"milliamp hours) from the battery."
msgstr ":code:`pack_capacity_mah( instance )` - 返回电池的满充容量（毫安时）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:302
#: aa45a145ad6f4288bd7708c4c2ac59ef
msgid ""
":code:`has_failsafed()` - Returns true if any of the batteries being "
"monitored have triggered a failsafe."
msgstr ":code:`has_failsafed()` - 如果任何被监控的电池触发了失控保护则返回 true。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:304
#: eca16af06adf41c7b9b8441ab77782fe
msgid ""
":code:`overpower_detected( instance )` - Returns true if too much power is "
"being drawn from the battery being monitored."
msgstr ":code:`overpower_detected( instance )` - 如果被监控的电池正在输出过多功率则返回 true。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:306
#: 1a55779650654858ae35caab319a686f
msgid ""
":code:`get_temperature( instance )` - Returns the temperature of the battery"
" in degrees Celsius if the battery supports temperature monitoring."
msgstr ":code:`get_temperature( instance )` - 如果电池支持温度监控，则返回电池温度（摄氏度）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:308
#: f991aad0890f4ae583ec9e21d747b6b5
msgid ""
":code:`get_cycle_count( instance )` - Returns cycle count of the battery or "
"nil if not available."
msgstr ":code:`get_cycle_count( instance )` - 返回电池循环次数，如果不可用则返回 nil。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:312
#: 6a1e840ea2114c86897724113c6fe111
msgid "GPS (gps:)"
msgstr "GPS (gps:)"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:314
#: 6d77c519b7c6405f8b87c0f9d9bc08c1
msgid ""
"The GPS library provides access to information about the GPS's on the "
"vehicle."
msgstr "GPS 库提供对飞行器 GPS 信息的访问。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:316
#: f47010ba5edf4d139bb2e7426523b92f
msgid ""
":code:`num_sensors()` - Returns the number of connected GPS devices. If GPS "
"blending is turned on that will show up as the third sensor, and be reported"
" here."
msgstr ""
":code:`num_sensors()` - 返回已连接 GPS 设备的数量。如果开启 GPS 融合，第三个传感器将代表融合结果并在此统计。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:318
#: c342baece6474d3fbdd4af4995b5d3ce
msgid ""
":code:`primary_sensor()` - Returns which GPS is currently being used as the "
"primary GPS device."
msgstr ":code:`primary_sensor()` - 返回当前被用作主 GPS 设备的 GPS 编号。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:320
#: 023eade8a4b8441c921ffa5996318889
msgid ""
":code:`status(instance)` - Returns the GPS fix status. Compare this to one "
"of the GPS fix types (GPS.NO_GPS, GPS.GPS_OK_FIX_2D, GPS.GPS_OK_FIX_3D "
"GPS.GPS_OK_FIX_3D_DGPS GPS.GPS_OK_FIX_3D_RTK_FLOAT "
"GPS.GPS_OK_FIX_3D_RTK_FIXED"
msgstr ""
":code:`status(instance)` - 返回 GPS "
"定位状态。与以下定位类型之一对比：GPS.NO_GPS、GPS.GPS_OK_FIX_2D、GPS.GPS_OK_FIX_3D、GPS.GPS_OK_FIX_3D_DGPS、GPS.GPS_OK_FIX_3D_RTK_FLOAT、GPS.GPS_OK_FIX_3D_RTK_FIXED。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:322
#: f280ac7ba46e443b82c62dc3d60b9c5d
msgid ""
":code:`location( instance )` - Returns a Location userdata for the last GPS "
"position. You must check the status to know if the location is still "
"current, if it is NO_GPS, or NO_FIX then it will be returning old data."
msgstr ""
":code:`location( instance )` - 返回最后一次 GPS 位置的 Location "
"用户数据。须检查状态以确认位置是否仍为最新，若为 NO_GPS 或 NO_FIX，则返回的是旧数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:324
#: 5586df2f532248ab95c22395670a331b
msgid ""
":code:`speed_accuracy( instance )` - Returns nil, or the speed accuracy of "
"the GPS in meters per second, if the information is available for the GPS "
"instance."
msgstr ""
":code:`speed_accuracy( instance )` - 返回 nil，或当该 GPS 实例信息可用时的速度精度（米/秒）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:326
#: 06e105bed9e7434ca36cbc40d3f71c9c
msgid ""
":code:`horizontal_accuracy( instance )` - Returns nil, or the horizontal "
"accuracy of the GPS in meters, if the information is available for the GPS "
"instance."
msgstr ""
":code:`horizontal_accuracy( instance )` - 返回 nil，或当该 GPS 实例信息可用时的水平精度（米）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:328
#: ae9516a11dac4b93bb4e0073d226a22a
msgid ""
":code:`vertical_accuracy( instance )` - Returns nil, or the vertical "
"accuracy of the GPS in meters, if the information is available for the GPS "
"instance."
msgstr ""
":code:`vertical_accuracy( instance )` - 返回 nil，或当该 GPS 实例信息可用时的垂直精度（米）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:330
#: 825c52bf1965428db61d311f837ef8e1
msgid ""
":code:`velocity( instance )` - Returns a Vector3f that contains the velocity"
" as observed by the GPS. You must check the status to know if the velocity "
"is still current."
msgstr ""
":code:`velocity( instance )` - 返回包含 GPS 观测速度的 Vector3f。须检查状态以确认速度是否仍为最新。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:332
#: 815bc4593ddd4108b01f4104f859dc77
msgid ""
":code:`ground_speed( instance )` - Returns the ground speed of the vehicle "
"in meters per second. You must check the status to know if the ground speed "
"is still current."
msgstr ":code:`ground_speed( instance )` - 返回飞行器地速（米/秒）。须检查状态以确认地速是否仍为最新。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:334
#: 63a9b159c9a44ddbb63d69f57a184b53
msgid ""
":code:`ground_course( instance )` - Returns the ground course of the vehicle"
" in degrees. You must check the status to know if the ground course is still"
" current."
msgstr ":code:`ground_course( instance )` - 返回飞行器地面航向（度）。须检查状态以确认航向是否仍为最新。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:336
#: 39177cbe2bff478bb876d4cb52aa33c8
msgid ""
":code:`num_sats( instance )` - Returns the number of satellites that the GPS"
" is currently tracking."
msgstr ":code:`num_sats( instance )` - 返回 GPS 当前跟踪的卫星数量。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:338
#: f147270696664c30baeb351eefba47c5
msgid ":code:`time_week( instance )` - Returns the GPS week number."
msgstr ":code:`time_week( instance )` - 返回 GPS 周数。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:340
#: 49a30bcabd7445bc855d0931018f0c98
msgid ""
":code:`time_week_ms( instance )` - Returns the number of milliseconds into "
"the current week."
msgstr ":code:`time_week_ms( instance )` - 返回当前 GPS 周内的毫秒数。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:342
#: 35c8c50c676f40388424bdcb9ee722b8
msgid ""
":code:`get_hdop( instance )` - Returns the horizontal dilution of precision "
"of the GPS instance."
msgstr ":code:`get_hdop( instance )` - 返回该 GPS 实例的水平精度因子（HDOP）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:344
#: 452c3a88a0ea4deeb30205b8d180903b
msgid ""
":code:`get_vdop( instance )` - Returns the vertical dilution of precision of"
" the GPS instance."
msgstr ":code:`get_vdop( instance )` - 返回该 GPS 实例的垂直精度因子（VDOP）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:346
#: c243d1879b244220b86fcb27eaaaa353
msgid ""
":code:`last_fix_time_ms( instance )` - Returns the time of the last fix in "
"system milliseconds."
msgstr ":code:`last_fix_time_ms( instance )` - 返回最后一次定位的系统毫秒时间戳。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:348
#: 78e9b97d875243d0816267f009d7c6dd
msgid ""
":code:`have_vertical_velocity( instance )` - Returns true if the GPS "
"instance can report the vertical velocity."
msgstr ""
":code:`have_vertical_velocity( instance )` - 如果该 GPS 实例可报告垂直速度则返回 true。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:350
#: 953a4ffecd8f4165b7b95982635ce912
msgid ""
":code:`get_antenna_offset( instance )` - Returns a Vector3f that contains "
"the offsets of the GPS in meters in the body frame."
msgstr ""
":code:`get_antenna_offset( instance )` - 返回包含 GPS 在机体坐标系中偏移量（米）的 Vector3f。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:352
#: 927109b98c174b6e87ed9a1757d72bb8
msgid ""
":code:`first_unconfigured_gps()` - Returns nil or the instance number of the"
" first GPS that has not been fully configured. If all GPS's have been "
"configured this returns 255 if all the GPS's have been configured."
msgstr ""
":code:`first_unconfigured_gps()` - 返回 nil 或第一个未完全配置的 GPS 实例编号。如果所有 GPS "
"均已配置，则返回 255。"

