#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:386
#: 1ad02274c2174d0a9daa2a1999be3508
msgid ""
"This library allows the control of WS8212B RGB LED strings via an output "
"reserved for scripting and  selected by SERVOx_FUNCTION = 94 thru 109 "
"(Script Out 1 thru 16)"
msgstr ""
"该库允许通过为脚本保留的输出（由 SERVOx_FUNCTION = 94 到 109（脚本输出 1 到 16）选择）控制 WS2812B RGB "
"LED 灯条。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:388
#: 22a23678e62c4e47a1533bba1f01208a
msgid ""
":code:`set_num_LEDs( output_number ,  number_of_LEDs )` - Sets the "
"number_of_LEDs in the string on a servo output. output_number is servo "
"output number 1-16 that the string is attached to with a string having "
"<number_of_LEDs>."
msgstr ""
":code:`set_num_LEDs( output_number ,  number_of_LEDs )` - 设置连接在某舵机输出上的 LED "
"灯串的 LED 数量。output_number 是灯串所连接的舵机输出编号（1-16），灯串有 <number_of_LEDs> 个 LED。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:390
#: dbaf7a1562714106a5ea22f6725c429a
msgid ""
":code:`set_RGB( output_number ,  LED_number ,  r , g , b )` - Set the data "
"for LED_number (1-32) on the string attached servo output_number (1-16) "
"output to the r,g,b values (0-255)"
msgstr ""
":code:`set_RGB( output_number ,  LED_number ,  r , g , b )` - 将连接在舵机输出 "
"output_number（1-16）上的灯串中 LED_number（1-32）的数据设置为 r, g, b 值（0-255）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:392
#: 840eb1e9fc554d7981893a9eea568271
