":code:`play_tune( tune )` - Plays a MML tune through the buzzer on the "
"vehicle. The tune is provided as a string."
msgstr ":code:`play_tune( tune )` - 通过飞行器蜂鸣器播放 MML 旋律。旋律以字符串形式提供。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:400
