msgid "Vehicle (vehicle:)"
msgstr "Vehicle (vehicle:)"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:406
#: 2061bc3361ff4902811730dca85fc373
msgid ""
":code:`set_mode(mode_number)` - Attempts to change vehicle (in this example "
"Plane) mode to mode_number. Returns true if successful, false if mode change"
" is not successful."
msgstr ""
":code:`set_mode(mode_number)` - 尝试将飞行器（本例中为固定翼）切换到 mode_number 对应的模式。成功则返回 "
"true，切换失败则返回 false。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:408
#: 3ff8483a4fcd448a956fff80f96d8d9a
msgid ":code:`get_mode()` - Returns current vehicle mode by mode_number."
msgstr ":code:`get_mode()` - 以 mode_number 返回飞行器当前模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:410
#: 558d2983f52149a5a994290373f5d9fd
msgid ""
"Mode numbers for each vehicle type can be `found here "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/ardupilotmega.html#PLANE_MODE>`__"
msgstr ""
"各飞行器类型的模式编号可 `在此查看 "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/ardupilotmega.html#PLANE_MODE>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:412
#: 16e0cd35544f4ebcb50993447ff0ca71
msgid ""
":code:`get_likely_flying()` - Returns true if the autopilot thinks it is "
"flying. Not guaranteed to be accurate."
msgstr ":code:`get_likely_flying()` - 如果飞控认为飞行器正在飞行则返回 true。不保证完全准确。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:414
#: 5989034d4cd6415dac72fa4345b49b92
msgid ""
":code:`get_flying_time_ms()` - Returns time in milliseconds since the "
"autopilot thinks it started flying, or zero if not currently flying."
