#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:473
#: eefe0de3364d4632b14b894f249f5f31
msgid "Serial (serial:)"
msgstr "Serial (serial:)"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:475
#: 1f677317723e47359548a1b4a0725eee
msgid ""
"The serial library provides access to ArduPilot's serial port infrastructure"
" and associated devices and drivers. The script can communicate with a "
"device attached to the autopilot using the ``find_serial(instance)`` "
"function. The script can also itself simulate being a device attached to the"
" autopilot using the ``find_simulated_device(protocol, instance)`` function "
"and ``SCR_SDEV*`` parameters."
msgstr ""
"serial 库提供对 ArduPilot 串口基础设施及相关设备和驱动程序的访问。脚本可使用 ``find_serial(instance)`` "
"函数与连接到飞控的设备通信，也可使用 ``find_simulated_device(protocol, instance)`` 函数及 "
"``SCR_SDEV*`` 参数模拟连接到飞控的设备。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:477
#: c430742b6fdd4d3a8dcc83289e0e9de9
msgid ""
"``find_serial(instance)`` - Returns a serial access object that allows a "
"script to interface with a device over a port set to protocol 28 (Scripting)"
" (e.g. ``SERIALx_PROTOCOL``, though CAN/NET/etc ports work as well). "
"Instance 0 is the first such port, instance 1 the second, and so on. If the "
"requested instance is not found, returns ``nil``."
msgstr ""
"``find_serial(instance)`` - 返回串口访问对象，允许脚本通过设置为协议 28（Scripting）的端口与设备通信（如 "
"``SERIALx_PROTOCOL``，CAN/NET 等端口也支持）。实例 0 为第一个此类端口，实例 1 "
"为第二个，依此类推。如果请求的实例未找到，则返回 ``nil``。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:479
#: 0754f9bcdaa64bdd82faccaf18611e08
msgid ""
"``find_simulated_device(protocol, instance)`` - Returns a serial access "
"object that allows a script to simulate a device attached via a specific "
"protocol. The device protocol is configured by the parameter "
"``SCR_SDEVx_PROTO``. Instance 0 is the first such protocol, instance 1 the "
"second, and so on. If the requested instance is not found, or the parameter "
"``SCR_SDEV_EN`` is disabled, returns ``nil``."
msgstr ""
"``find_simulated_device(protocol, instance)`` - "
"返回串口访问对象，允许脚本模拟通过特定协议连接的设备。设备协议由参数 ``SCR_SDEVx_PROTO`` 配置。实例 0 为第一个此类协议，实例 1"
" 为第二个，依此类推。如果请求的实例未找到，或参数 ``SCR_SDEV_EN`` 已禁用，则返回 ``nil``。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:481
#: 5d6c1460447f481a98137046d4516a16
msgid ""
"The objects returned by the above functions support the following methods:"
msgstr "上述函数返回的对象支持以下方法："

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:483
#: 11d17e29266a48cd8acf947bd8edbb6e
msgid ""
"``port:begin(baud_rate)`` - Start communication at the given baud rate. Must"
" be called to initialize scripting protocol ports (those from "
"``find_serial``). No effect for device simulation ports (those from "
"``find_simulated_device``)."
msgstr ""
"``port:begin(baud_rate)`` - 以指定波特率开始通信。须调用此方法初始化脚本协议端口（来自 ``find_serial`` "
"的端口）。对设备模拟端口（来自 ``find_simulated_device`` 的端口）无效。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:485
#: 57e2dac3b11746f39f7ba12b159318a8
msgid ""
"``port:write(value)`` - Write a single byte. Returns 1 if successful, or 0 "
"if failed (i.e. buffer space full)."
msgstr "``port:write(value)`` - 写入单个字节。成功返回 1，失败（如缓冲区已满）返回 0。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:487
#: dfbf8d9af1854307abdb855f4dfd0b3b
msgid ""
"``port:writestring(data)`` - Write a string. The number of bytes actually "
"written, i.e. the length of the written prefix of the string, is returned. "
"It may be 0 up to the length of the string."
msgstr ""
"``port:writestring(data)`` - 写入字符串。返回实际写入的字节数，即字符串已写入前缀的长度，范围为 0 到字符串长度。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:489
#: 7f50680cd0724f818ba3334845d5339d
msgid ""
"``port:read()`` - Read a single byte. Returns the byte if successful, or -1 "
"if failed (i.e. none available or some other error)."
msgstr "``port:read()`` - 读取单个字节。成功返回该字节，失败（如无数据或其他错误）返回 -1。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:491
#: b6f2bcb68cd049d6a14e50ad339a0fda
msgid ""
"``port:readstring(count)`` - Read up to ``count`` bytes and return the bytes"
" read as a string. No bytes may be read, in which case a 0-length string is "
"returned. If there is an error, ``nil`` is returned."
msgstr ""
"``port:readstring(count)`` - 读取最多 ``count`` 个字节并以字符串形式返回。如果未读取到任何字节，则返回长度为 0"
" 的字符串。如果发生错误，则返回 ``nil``。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:493
#: 773250ff20364ddfb2f2a8dc00c22b70
msgid ""
"``port:available()`` - Returns the number of bytes available to read. A read"
" of the given number of bytes may fail on certain errors or if there is "
"another reader (e.g. mavlink passthrough), though these are extremely "
"unlikely occurrences."
msgstr ""
"``port:available()`` - 返回可读取的字节数。在某些错误情况下或存在其他读取方（如 mavlink "
"透传）时，读取指定字节数可能失败，但这种情况极少发生。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:495
#: 3e93ef06b69c43168f64ce58c121a3bd
msgid ""
"``port:set_flow_control(fcs)`` - Set flow control setting for scripting "
"protocol ports (those from ``find_serial``). No effect for device simulation"
" ports (those from ``find_simulated_device``). ``fcs`` can be 0 to disable, "
"1 to enable, or 2 for automatic mode."
msgstr ""
"``port:set_flow_control(fcs)`` - 设置脚本协议端口（来自 ``find_serial`` "
"的端口）的流控。对设备模拟端口（来自 ``find_simulated_device`` 的端口）无效。``fcs`` 可设为 0（禁用）、1（启用）或"
" 2（自动模式）。"

