#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:548
#: c305c2df131548bb827ae249fc0b324d
msgid "How to Add New Bindings"
msgstr "如何添加新绑定"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:550
#: a3474b7c071848fa9fb7c27d58e6663f
msgid ""
"To give Lua scripts access to more features of ArduPilot the API can be "
"extended by creating new bindings. The process is as follows:"
msgstr "要使 Lua 脚本访问 ArduPilot 的更多功能，可通过创建新绑定来扩展 API。流程如下："

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:552
#: 729e0fa5d8d24ae587cab39f8b130abf
msgid ""
"Find the method or function you would like to expose to Lua. For example if "
"you wanted to expose an additional feature of AHRS you would first find the "
"method within `libraries/AP_AHRS/AP_AHRS.h "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_AHRS/AP_AHRS.h>`__."
" This can be an already existing method (function) or a method (function) "
"newly added to the code."
msgstr ""
"找到您想向 Lua 公开的方法或函数。例如，如果要公开 AHRS 的额外功能，首先在 `libraries/AP_AHRS/AP_AHRS.h "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_AHRS/AP_AHRS.h>`__"
" 中找到该方法。这可以是已有方法（函数），也可以是新添加到代码中的方法（函数）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:553
#: a2fd04de15444cfaadba0c2619d06698
msgid ""
"Edit the `libraries/AP_Scripting/generator/description/bindings.desc "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/generator/description/bindings.desc>`__"
" and add a new line in the appropriate section for the method, or add a new "
"section if a new class shall be added by following the examples of the other"
" sections."
msgstr ""
"编辑 `libraries/AP_Scripting/generator/description/bindings.desc "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/generator/description/bindings.desc>`__，在适当章节添加新行，或按照其他章节的示例添加新章节（如需添加新类）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:554
#: a190fa77e60c44b4be99f056985fcfa0
msgid ""
"Add the method or function to `libraries/AP_Scripting/docs/docs.lua "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/docs/docs.lua>`__."
msgstr ""
"将方法或函数添加到 `libraries/AP_Scripting/docs/docs.lua "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/docs/docs.lua>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:555
#: 3d22440f96d8408886fff7930b5e5732
msgid ""
"Clean the distribution (./waf distclean) and restart compilation from there "
"as usual."
msgstr "清理发行版（./waf distclean）并从头重新编译。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:558
#: 2ed9a8b329da40edb720a83b80256b95
msgid "Include Lua scripts in firmware directly"
msgstr "将 Lua 脚本直接嵌入固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lua-scripts.rst:560
#: 40f0f1e649ce4d0f9e5c4ede879611c1
msgid ""
"Lua scripts may be directly embedded in firmware binaries, rather than being"
" placed on an external SD card. This is useful for manufacturer's to provide"
" the scripts for included peripherals or when the autopilot does not support"
" an SD card. Instructions to do so are on `this link "
"<https://ardupilot.org/dev/docs/common-oem-customizations.html#>`__."
msgstr ""
"Lua 脚本可直接嵌入固件二进制文件，而无需放在外部 SD 卡上。这对于制造商为随附外设提供脚本，或飞控不支持 SD 卡的情况非常有用。详情请参见 "
"`此链接 <https://ardupilot.org/dev/docs/common-oem-customizations.html#>`__。"

